{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And behold a smoking furnace and a flaming torch</b>: He saw as though the whole thing were a smoking furnace, and within it a flaming torch burning, in the manner of \"a great cloud and a fire flashing\" (Ezekiel 1:4). And the smoke is the cloud and the darkness mentioned at the giving of the Torah (Deuteronomy 4:11), and the torch of fire within it is the fire concerning which it is said there (Deuteronomy 4:36), \"and His words you heard out of the midst of the fire,\" and it is written (Exodus 24:17), \"and the appearance of the glory of HaShem was like a devouring fire,\" etc. Behold, the Shekhinah passed between the pieces, and this is the covenant that was with Him from eternity, and this is the meaning of \"HaShem cut a covenant with Abram,\" for the Holy One, blessed be He, Himself passed the covenant between the pieces. And the enlightened will understand."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:29:51.591370363Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}